    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11342" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαμάω</span></b>  (A), fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήσω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cut off,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπ᾽ οὔατα νηλέϊ χαλκῶ ῥῖνάς τ᾽
					ἀμήσαντες</span>”
