					Od.
					21.300
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				181
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπάμησον [τὸν πόδα</span>]
				<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				749
			</span></i>:— in 
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Lap.</u>
				21
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ στάχυν ἀμήσασθαι</span>”
