					Q.S.
					13.242
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				4.413
			</span></i>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰπᾱ-</span> in 
